  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: C&#xF4;te d&apos;Ivoire &#x2013; Employability programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve the access of youth to employment and entrepreneurship in the horticulture value chain in the Poro region.This will be done through two initiatives:1.	Training of young people to develop their initiative and entrepreneurship mindset, their knowledge of the horticulture sector and its job opportunities, their capacity to find a job and to be self-financing;2.	Facilitating access of youth to practical experiences through a formal internship or job.</narrative>
  </description>
